<<keyOption [[I understand|Intro]] ✔ btn>>
:: Intro {"position":"1025,825"}
<<set _sexOptions = ["man", "woman", "futanari"]>>\
<<set _genderOptions = ["him", "her", "them"]>>
Your name is <<textbox "$player.name" "David">>, a young <<listbox '_sex' autoselect>><<optionsfrom _sexOptions>><</listbox>>
 living by <<listbox '_gender' autoselect>><<optionsfrom _genderOptions>><</listbox>>self in a quiet home. On the outside you’re just a regular person going about their everyday life, but in reality you’re nothing like that.

If your true self were to be revealed, the entirety of your freedom would cease to exist. Safe to say that your exotic kinks should probably be kept to yourself, unless you want to attract unwanted attention.

Today is a beautiful Monday morning, the start of your new life. For too long your desires could only be mere fantasies to feed your urges. Today those fantasies will become reality, they will become everything you desired and more. Today marks the day of your life as a child slave trainer, training any kid to do your bidding, as well as satisfy your urges that have long been rejected…

<<keyAction Start ▶️ btn>>
  <<set
    Player.setSex(_sex == "man" ? "male" : _sex == "woman" ? "female" : "herm");
    Player.setGender(_gender == "him" ? "male" : _gender == "her" ? "female" : "nb");
    $player.name to $('#textbox-playername').val();
    >>
  <<goto IntroBed>>/*[[IntroBed]]*/
<</keyAction>>
<<done>>
  <<run
    $('#listbox--gender').on('change', function() {
      var playerName = $('#textbox-playername');
      var currentName = playerName.val();
      if(this.value == 1 && currentName == "David")
        playerName.val("Emma");
      else if(currentName == "Emma")
        playerName.val("David");
      $('#pronoun').html(this.value == 1 ? "her" : "him");
    });
  >>
<</done>>
:: IntroBed {"position":"1025,700"}
<<scenery bed>>
As the sun reveals the world to a nice Monday morning, you climb out of bed, ready to start a new day. <<print either("The birds chip happily in the morning sun and the trees rustle alive in the early breeze.", "The morning sun shines through your room, illuminating it in a nice warm glow.")>>

Today is the day that you begin your debauchery.

<<keyOption [[Leave your room|IntroMain]] 🚪>>
<<keyOption [[Skip intro|main]] ⏭>>
:: IntroMain {"position":"1025,575"}
<<scenery mainRoom>>
As you leave your room, you walk into your living room. It’s not the most ideal layout, but at least you have a house with the terrible paychecks you get from work.

Glancing at the clock, you note that you have a good hour and a half before you need to leave for work. It starts at 8 o’clock, but it’s also a 30-minute drive away.

To pass the time you decide to head on down to the basement. It would probably be best if you plan out how you were going to keep a child down there.

<<keyOption [[The Basement|IntroBasement]] 🚪>>
<<keyOption [[Skip intro|main]] ⏭>>
:: IntroBasement {"position":"1025,450"}
<<addMinutes 60>>\
<<scenery basement>>
Walking down creaky wooden steps, you arrive at the basement. It's quite barren with a concrete layout and exposed piping visible. But as much as it sucks, it is the most preferable option to keep a slave held in.

You already have a couple things set up. An old mattress has been laid on the ground for future ‘guests’, and a simple lock was installed on the door to help prevent any escapes. You determine that you’ll need a couple more items before you’re ready to hold someone here. At least some restraints and optionally some sound padding, would all be the necessary components. Technically you could also use your own bedroom too, but the sound muffling the basement provides is so much better.

After a bit of daydreaming about your hopeful future, you check the time to see that you have about 30 minutes left until you need to leave for work. You could hang around the house for the time being, otherwise you could leave now.

<<keyOption [[Go outside|IntroHouse]] 🏡>>
<<keyOption [[Skip intro|main]] ⏭>>
:: IntroHouse {"position":"825,375"}
<<scenery home>>
Your home doesn’t contain much, but it’s a home that you’ve grown accustomed to. Along with the living space, you also have a job working as a $player.job.name. It doesn’t pay much, but something is better than nothing.

